bulk", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "rtk-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 1642.35, "width": 1200, "height": 88.65, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 13869965, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 35251762, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "rtk-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 1656.35, "width": 1172, "height": 60.650000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 78396819, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 91270337, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Frontend API slices (RTK Query) \u2014 src/lib/features\nauth \u00b7 user \u00b7 users \u00b7 org \u00b7 job \u00b7 lane \u00b7 candidate \u00b7 checklist \u00b7 calendar\nnotifications \u00b7 settings \u00b7 files \u00b7 analytics \u00b7 onboarding \u00b7 api (base)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Frontend API slices (RTK Query) \u2014 src/lib/features\nauth \u00b7 user \u00b7 users \u00b7 org \u00b7 job \u00b7 lane \u00b7 candidate \u00b7 checklist \u00b7 calendar\nnotifications \u00b7 settings \u00b7 files \u00b7 analytics \u00b7 onboarding \u00b7 api (base)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "models-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 1751.0, "width": 1200, "height": 123.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 78941836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 79317609, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "models-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 1765.0, "width": 1172, "height": 95.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 19420554, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 35057038, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "MongoDB models \u2014 src/lib/models\nOrganization \u00b7 User \u00b7 Job \u00b7 Lane \u00b7 JobLaneConfig \u00b7 Candidate \u00b7 CandidateAccount\nHistory \u00b7 Settings \u00b7 Notification \u00b7 FormField \u00b7 ChecklistTemplate\nCVBatch \u00b7 DuplicateCandidates \u00b7 FileShare \u00b7 FileUrlMapping\nEmailHistory \u00b7 ScheduledReminder \u00b7 WebhookSubscription", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "MongoDB models \u2014 src/lib/models\nOrganization \u00b7 User \u00b7 Job \u00b7 Lane \u00b7 JobLaneConfig \u00b7 Candidate \u00b7 CandidateAccount\nHistory \u00b7 Settings \u00b7 Notification \u00b7 FormField \u00b7 ChecklistTemplate\nCVBatch \u00b7 DuplicateCandidates \u00b7 FileShare \u00b7 FileUrlMapping\nEmailHistory \u00b7 ScheduledReminder \u00b7 WebhookSubscription", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "flow-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 1898.75, "width": 1200, "height": 176.4, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 35181099, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 26765397, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "flow-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 1912.75, "width": 1172, "height": 148.4, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 51491007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 12632672, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "END-TO-END FUNCTIONAL FLOW\n1. Register org + admin \u2192 2. Onboarding (portal, SMTP, storage, captcha, meetings, AI)\n3. Create users (HR/Interviewers) \u2192 4. Create Job + form fields + lanes/checklist config\n5. Intake: publish to apply-jobs OR guest-apply OR bulk CV (process-cv) OR manual candidate\n6. AI evaluate (optional) \u2192 7. Kanban: status, checklist, remarks, history, duplicates\n8. Assign + schedule (Google/Teams/Zoom) + event-mail \u2192 9. Reminders cron / Teams reminder test\n10. Decision status \u2192 emails/notifications \u2192 11. Analytics funnel/trends/performance\nRealtime: mutations \u2192 broadcast (WebSocket) \u2192 other dashboard clients in same org", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "END-TO-END FUNCTIONAL FLOW\n1. Register org + admin \u2192 2. Onboarding (portal, SMTP, storage, captcha, meetings, AI)\n3. Create users (HR/Interviewers) \u2192 4. Create Job + form fields + lanes/checklist config\n5. Intake: publish to apply-jobs OR guest-apply OR bulk CV (process-cv) OR manual candidate\n6. AI evaluate (optional) \u2192 7. Kanban: status, checklist, remarks, history, duplicates\n8. Assign + schedule (Google/Teams/Zoom) + event-mail \u2192 9. Reminders cron / Teams reminder test\n10. Decision status \u2192 emails/notifications \u2192 11. Analytics funnel/trends/performance\nRealtime: mutations \u2192 broadcast (WebSocket) \u2192 other dashboard clients in same org", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "note-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 2095.15, "width": 1200, "height": 106.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 78278708, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 93252774, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "note-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 2109.15, "width": 1172, "height": 78.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 99529864, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 99937571, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Scope note\nThis board = HireTrack core app only (product behavior + every HTTP API in tree).\nLicense-admin and release/CI installer are separate projects \u2014 not expanded here.\nFR IDs map roughly: Identity F1 \u00b7 Jobs F2 \u00b7 Pipeline F3 \u00b7 Interviews F4 \u00b7 AI F5 \u00b7 Files F6 \u00b7 Comms F7 \u00b7 Analytics/ops F8.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Scope note\nThis board = HireTrack core app only (product behavior + every HTTP API in tree).\nLicense-admin and release/CI installer are separate projects \u2014 not expanded here.\nFR IDs map roughly: Identity F1 \u00b7 Jobs F2 \u00b7 Pipeline F3 \u00b7 Interviews F4 \u00b7 AI F5 \u00b7 Files F6 \u00b7 Comms F7 \u00b7 Analytics/ops F8.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#f8f9fa"}, "files": {}}